-- Q521: Property Transactions: Gains/Losses [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under Section 1(h)(1)(E), unrecaptured Section 1250 gain equals the straight-line depreciation claimed on real property, taxed at a maximum 25% rate. The total gain is $400,000 ($800,000 minus $400,000 adjusted basis), of which $200,000 represents depreciation claimed. This $200,000 is the unrecaptured Section 1250 gain; the remaining $200,000 is Section 1231 gain taxed at regular capital gains rates.
