-- Q583: S Corporations [easy/L1]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): The four-tier S corporation loss limitation is applied in order: (1) stock and debt basis under Sections 1366(d) and 1367, (2) at-risk limitation under Section 465, (3) passive activity limitation under Section 469, and (4) excess business loss limitation under Section 461(l). Losses must pass each successive tier before the next applies, and suspended amounts carry forward separately at each tier.
Wrong (A): This places passive activity first and basis third, which reverses the correct ordering; basis must be tested before at-risk or passive rules.
Wrong (C): This places at-risk first and basis second; the basis limitation must precede the at-risk limitation in the statutory ordering.
